From: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 14:31:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Resolve optional Eclipse tools in their execution context

HelpIndexBuilder runs inside the requested Eclipse application. Load its
class from that framework and preserve the exception thrown by the
indexing implementation, so schema conversion can build independently
of the Eclipse help server.

Resolve the standalone director archive only when standalone mode is
selected. Reuse cached archives and the active Maven session's offline
policy and plugin repositories. The internal director uses its existing
provisioning services.

Load the optional Snappy archiver when its format is selected. ZIP and
tar.gz product archives use the installed archive implementations.

Report bundle resolution requirements when a local p2 repository fixture
cannot be read.

Upstream: no
Reference: https://github.com/eclipse-tycho/tycho/tree/tycho-5.0.3
Signed-off-by: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
